## HAZ-DOC-001: REQ-001-unified-inbound-inbox — Provisional Document Accessible Before Filing Complete

**Source requirement:** [REQ-001-unified-inbound-inbox](requirements/increment-1-inbox-and-triage/REQ-001-unified-inbound-inbox.md)  
**DCB0129 §4.1:** Clinical safety  
**Status:** Active — CSO sign-off pending (D-031)  


**Hazard description:** A document in Provisional status is accessible to users before filing is complete.

**Potential clinical impact:** User opens and acts on a document that has not yet been filed to the patient record. Clinical action, coding, or task creation occurs on the basis of a document whose status is still Provisional. If the document is subsequently corrected, rejected, or re-matched, the clinical action taken may be inconsistent with the final filed version.

