**Residual risk:** [TBD Severity] x [TBD Likelihood] = **[TBD]**
**Residual risk decision:** [TBD - CSO to complete at Phase 6]

**Existing Controls:** REQ-001 AC: Provisional status visibly labelled on all document rows. D-002: filing alone commits the record - Provisional window is defined and bounded.

